OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 22, dies in hospital days
OL,4,Aafter van crashed near village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died in hospital days after
OL,7,Fhis van crashed near a village in
OL,8,FAberdeenshire.
OL,10,FArnas MacKonis, 22, was driving a white
OL,11,FMercedes Sprinter which crashed on the
OL,12,FA947 near King Edward at about 05:30 on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FHe suffered serious injuries and was
OL,16,Ftaken to Aberdeen Royal Infirmary,
OL,17,Fwhere he later died on Thursday.
OL,19,FSgt Sarah Ritchie said an investigation
OL,20,Finto the crash is ongoing and has urged
OL,21,Fany witnesses, particular those with
OL,22,Fdashcam footage, to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
